OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft's permanent homecoming 
OL,4,Aafter 30 years                         
OL,6,FA 9ft (2.7m) statue of Tomb Raider star
OL,7,FLara Croft has been permanently        
OL,8,Finstalled in Derby, the birthplace of  
OL,9,Fthe franchise.                         
OL,11,FThe sculpture, which formed part of the
OL,12,FTomb Raider: The LIVE Experience at    
OL,13,FCamden Market in London, had been in   
OL,14,Fstorage since the attraction closed in 
OL,15,F2023, but moved to a temporary home at 
OL,16,Fthe Museum of Making last month.       
OL,18,FThe statue was installed at Derby      
OL,19,FMarket Hall on Friday after a #30,000  
OL,20,Ffundraising campaign brought it to the 
OL,21,Fcity as a permanent tribute to Derby's 
OL,22,Frole in video game folklore.           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
